Subject: [PATCH 09/16] pro1x-haptics

From fxtec-pro1x-nixos device/kernel/patches/pro1x-haptics.patch (nyymi609, written
against v7.1), rebased onto v7.3 for the SailfishOS port. The board DTS hunks were
3-way merged with upstream 7.1..7.3 changes to sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts.

LLMGD-0 A0
---
 .../boot/dts/qcom/sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts      |   6 +
 drivers/input/misc/Kconfig                    |  12 +
 drivers/input/misc/Makefile                   |   1 +
 drivers/input/misc/aw86224.c                  | 298 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 317 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/input/misc/aw86224.c

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts
index 1c3b6ec07..588d545e1 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6115-fxtec-pro1x.dts
@@ -341,6 +341,12 @@ pca9534: gpio@21 {
 		#gpio-cells = <2>;
 	};
 
+	haptics: haptics@58 {
+		compatible = "awinic,aw86224";
+		reg = <0x58>;
+		reset-gpios = <&tlmm 68 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
+	};
+
 	gpioext0: gpio-expander@5b {
 		/* 8x8 keyboard matrix behind an AW9523B, see pro1x-aw9523-kbd.c */
 		compatible = "fxtec,pro1x-aw9523-keypad";
